return ['domain'=>'zinn-offload','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'so_SO','project-id-version'=>'zinn-offload','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-10-02T10:28:39+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-10-02T10:28:39+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Media Offload'=>'Zinn® Media Offload','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-offload'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-offload','Moves this site\'s media library to Zinn® object storage and serves it from a CDN. Configured from your Zinn® dashboard — no access key is ever typed into WordPress.'=>'Waxay maktabadda warbaahinta ee boggan u wareejisaa kaydka walxaha ee Zinn® waxayna ka adeegtaa CDN. Waxaa laga habeeyay dashboard-kaaga Zinn® — waligeed fure gelitaan laguma qorin WordPress.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Stored. Type a new value to replace it.'=>'Waa la kaydiyay. Geli qiimo cusub si aad ugu beddesho.','Filter this list…'=>'Kala shaandhee liiskan…','Filter this list'=>'Kala saar liiskan','Nothing matches that filter.'=>'Waxba kalama mid aha shaandhadaas.','Add a row'=>'Ku dar saf','Remove this row'=>'Ka saar safkan','Remove'=>'Ka saar','Zinn Digital®'=>'Zinn Digital®','Zinn Digital® — overview'=>'Zinn Digital® — dulmar guud','Overview'=>'Guudmar','Copied'=>'Waa la koobiyey','Every Zinn® plugin on this site, and whether it is working.'=>'Balan-kordhinta Zinn® kasta oo ku taal boggan, iyo haddii ay shaqaynayso.','No connection is needed for this plugin.'=>'Xiriir looma baahna furigan.','Open settings'=>'Fur habaynta','You do not have permission to change these settings.'=>'Uma lihid ogolaansho inaad bedesho goobahan.','Settings sections'=>'Qaybaha habaynta','Support'=>'Taageero','Save changes'=>'Kaydi isbeddelada','Tools'=>'Qalabka','Export settings'=>'Dhoofinta habaynta','Reset to defaults'=>'Dib ugu celi sidii hore','This puts every setting on this plugin back to its default. Continue?'=>'Tani waxay dib ugu celinaysaa goob kasta oo ka mid ah furinkan tiisii hore. Ma sii waddaa?','Diagnostics for support'=>'Baaritaanka taageerada','Import a settings file'=>'Soo geli faylka habaynta','Import'=>'Soo dhoofso','Exported files never contain passwords, tokens or API keys — you will need to enter those again on the new site.'=>'Faylasha la dhoofiyo waligood kuma jiraan ereyada sirta ah, calaamadaha ama furayaasha API — waxaad u baahan doontaa inaad mar kale geliso bogga cusub.','Settings saved.'=>'Habsocodka waa la keydiyay.','Every setting on this plugin is back to its default.'=>'Dejinta kasta oo ku saabsan fur-galkaan waxay ku noqotay sidii hore.','Done.'=>'Waa dhammaatay.','That action is not available.'=>'Falkaasi ma heli karo.','That file could not be read. Choose a settings file exported from a Zinn® plugin.'=>'Faylkaas lama akhrin karin. Dooro faylka habaynta ee laga soo dhoofiyay furin Zinn® ah.','That file is too large to be a settings export.'=>'Faylkaasi aad buu u weyn yahay inuu noqdo dhoofinta habaynta.','That file is not a Zinn® settings export.'=>'Faylkaasi ma aha dhoofinta habaynta Zinn®.','That file was exported from a different plugin (%s), so importing it here would store settings this plugin does not understand.'=>'Faylkaas waxaa laga soo dhoofiyay furin kale (%s), markaa halkan oo la soo geliyo waxay kaydinaysaa habayn aysan furintani fahmin.','%d setting imported. Passwords and API keys are never in an export, so enter those again.'=>'%d habayn ayaa la soo dejiyay. Erayada sirta ah iyo furayaasha API waligood kuma jiraan xogta la dhoofiyo, markaa fadlan mar kale geli.' . "\0" . '%d habayn ayaa la soo dejiyay. Erayada sirta ah iyo furayaasha API waligood kuma jiraan dhoofinta, markaa dib u geli kuwaas.','Zinn Digital® did not return a token. Nothing has been changed on this site.'=>'Zinn Digital® ma soo celin calaamad. Waxba lagama beddelin boggan.','This site is no longer connected to Zinn® media offload. New uploads will stay on this server. Pair it again from your Zinn Digital® dashboard.'=>'Boggan kuma xiriirsana Zinn® wareejinta warbaahinta. Soo-gelinta cusub waxay ku sii jiri doonaan serfer-kan. Mar labaad kaga lammaanee koontaroolkaaga Zinn Digital®.','Zinn Digital® answered with HTTP %d.'=>'Zinn Digital® wuxuu kaga jawaabay HTTP %d.','Disconnected by Zinn Digital®.'=>'Waxaa gooyay Zinn Digital®.','Connected'=>'Ku xiran','Connecting…'=>'Waa la xiriirinayaa…','Connected, but something needs attention'=>'Waa ku xidhan yahay, laakiin wax baa u baahan fiiro gaar ah','Not connected'=>'Kuma xirna','Running on your own account'=>'Ku shaqeynaya koontadaada gaarka ah','We could not check this'=>'Ma aanan hubin karin tan','This plugin did not say why. Send a diagnostics report and we will look.'=>'Furintaan ma sheegin sababta. Soo dir warbixinta baaritaanka annaguna waan eegi doonnaa.','Connection status'=>'Xaaladda xiriirka','Last checked %s ago.'=>'Baadhitaankii ugu dambeeyay %s kahor.','(opens in a new tab)'=>'(wuxuu ku furmayaa tab cusub)','Send this to Zinn® support'=>'Tan u dir taageerada Zinn®','This is exactly what will be sent — nothing else, and nothing hidden. Your passwords, tokens and API keys are not in it.'=>'Kani waa waxa saxda ah ee la diri doono — wax kale ma jiraan, wax qarsoonina ma jiraan. Furahaaga sirta ah, calamadahaaga iyo furayaasha API kuma jiraan.','The diagnostics report that will be sent'=>'Warbixinta ogaanshaha ee la diri doono','Copy to clipboard'=>'Nuqul ka qaad oo geli sabuuradda xusuusta','Send this report to Zinn® support'=>'U dir warbixintan taageerada Zinn®','We open a support ticket for you and reply by email. If you would rather not send it, copy it above and paste it into a ticket yourself.'=>'Waxaan kuu furaynaa tigidhka caawinta waxaana kugu soo jawaabaynaa iimayl. Haddii aad doorbidid inaadan dirin, kor ka koobiyeeyso oo adigu ku dheji tigidhka.','We could not reach Zinn Digital® from this server (%s). Copy the report above and open a ticket instead — nothing about your settings is wrong.'=>'Kama aan gaari karin Zinn Digital® server-kan (%s). Koobi garee warbixinta sare oo fur tigidh taa beddelkeeda — wax khalad ah kuma jiraan habayntaada.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report and will reply by email.'=>'Waa la diray. Taageerada Zinn® waxay heshay warbixintaada waxayna kaga jawaabi doontaa iimayl.','Sent. Zinn® support has your report — reference %s — and will reply by email.'=>'Waa la diray. Qaybta caawinta ee Zinn® waxay heshay warbixintaada — tixraaca %s — waxayna kaga jawaabi doontaa iimayl.','You have sent several reports in a short time. Wait a few minutes and try again — the earlier ones did arrive.'=>'Waxaad muddo gaaban gudaheed ku dirtay warbixino dhowr ah. Sug dhowr daqiiqo oo mar kale isku day — kuwii hore way gaareen.','Zinn Digital® could not accept the report just now — that is our end, not yours. Try again shortly, or copy the report above into a ticket.'=>'Zinn Digital® ma aqbali karin warbixinta hadda — taasi waa xaggeena, ma aha xaggaaga. Isku day mar dhow markale, ama koobi garee warbixinta sare oo ku dar tigidh.','The report was refused (HTTP %d). Copy it above and open a ticket, quoting that number.'=>'Warbixinta waa la diiday (HTTP %d). Nuqul ka samee xagga sare oo fur tigidh, adigoo lambarkaas xusaya.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — hagayaal iyo adeegyo','User guides'=>'Hagayaasha isticmaalaha','Read the %s user guide'=>'Akhri hagaha isticmaalaha %s','Hide this'=>'Qari kan','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Martigelinta Zinn® ee WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, keydinta xogta maalinlaha ah, wareejin bilaash ah iyo qaybta maamulka oo loo dhisay dadka maamula wax ka badan hal goob.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Suuqa Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Iibso oo iibi goobaha dhisan, magacyada domain-ka iyo meelaynta xiriiriyaha, iyadoo lacagta si ammaan ah loo hayo ilaa labada dhinacba ay ku qancaan.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — shaqaalayso dad shaqadoodu tahay arrintan','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Suuqayaga caalamiga ah ee xorta ah: baadh in ka badan 10,000 oo adeegyo diyaarsan oo ka yimid qorayaasha, naqshadeeyayaasha, horumariyayaasha iyo khubarada SEO, ama dheji mashruuc oo u oggolow inay dalab ku soo gudbiyaan.','Media Offload'=>'Kala-wareejinta Warbaahinta','Connection'=>'Xiriirka','What gets moved'=>'Waxa la wareejinayo','How media is served'=>'Sida warbaahinta loo adeegsado','Move a batch now'=>'Hadda rar qayb','Media already moved is never affected by a change here — its address does not change.'=>'Warbaahinta mar hore la raray marnaba ma saamayso isbeddelka halkan laga sameeyo — ciwaankeedu ma isbeddelo.','New uploads'=>'Soo-gelimmo cusub','Move new uploads to Zinn® storage as they arrive'=>'U rari waxyaabaha cusub ee la soo galiyo kaydka Zinn® marka ay yimaadaan','Existing media'=>'Warbaahinta jirta','Keep moving the media library that is already here'=>'Sii wad rarista maktabadda warbaahinta ee horey halkan u joogtay','A few files an hour, in the background, picking up where it left off. Turning this off pauses it; nothing already moved comes back.'=>'Dhowr fayl saacaddii, xagga dambe, iyada oo laga sii ambaqaadayo meeshii ay ku joogsatay. Deminta arrintan way hakinaysaa; wax hore loo raray dib uma soo noqdaan.','Files per hourly pass'=>'Faylasha halkii baas ee saacaddiiba','Each attachment is several files and every one is a full upload. Raise this on a fast host with a generous execution limit; lower it if passes are being cut short.'=>'Lifaaq kasta waxa uu ka kooban yahay dhowr fayl mid kastaana waa soo-gelineed buuxda. Tan ku kordhi martigeliye degdeg ah oo leh xadka fulinta oo ballaaran; hoos u dhig haddii wareegyadu ay go\'ayaan ka hor intaysan dhammaystirmin.','Leave files smaller than'=>'Ka tag faylasha ka yar','Kilobytes. A tiny icon costs more in the extra connection than it saves in disk, so there is rarely a reason to move one. Set to 0 to move everything.'=>'Kiiloo-bayt. Astaan aad u yar waxay ku baxdaa kharash dheeraad ah xagga xiriirka intii ay ku badbaadin lahayd disk-ga, sidaas darteed marar dhif ah ayaa jirta sabab loo raro. U deji 0 si aad wax walba u rarto.','Never move these types'=>'Waligaa ha dhaqaajin noocyadan','Useful when a plugin reads a file straight off the disk — a font, a PDF a form builder stamps, an audio file a player seeks inside.'=>'Waxtar leh marka fur-hagaajiyuhu si toos ah faylka uga akhriyo saxanka — farta qoraalka, PDF uu shaabadeeyay dhisaha foomka, fayl maqal ah oo ciyaaryahanku dhex raadiyo.','These two are the ones to be careful with — read each description before changing it.'=>'Labadaan ayaa ah kuwa ay tahay in laga digtoonaado — akhri sharaxaad kasta ka hor inta aadan beddelin.','Serve from Zinn® storage'=>'Ka adeeg kaydinta Zinn®','Point image and file addresses at Zinn® storage'=>'U tilmaan ciwaanada sawirka iyo faylka kaydinta Zinn®','Off, files are uploaded but still served from this server — which is the safe state while you check everything arrived. On, visitors are served from storage and this server stops carrying the traffic.'=>'Dami, faylasha waa la soo geliyay laakiin wali waxaa laga adeegaa adeegahaan — taas oo ah xaaladda aaminka ah inta aad hubinayso in wax walba yimaadeen. Daari, booqdayaasha waxaa looga adeegaa kaydka waxaana adeegahani joojinayaa qaadista taraafikada.','Free the disk space'=>'Banee booska diskiga','Delete the local copy once every size has uploaded'=>'Tirtir koobiga maxalliga ah marka xabbad kasta la soo geliyo','This is the point of offloading, and it is also the irreversible half. Leave it off until “Serve from Zinn® storage” is on and you have checked your site — a local copy is the only thing that saves you if something was missed.'=>'Tani waa ujeedka offloading-ka, waana qaybta aan dib loo celin karin. Iska daa iyadoo dansan ilaa “Serve from Zinn® storage” la shido oo aad hubiso boggaaga — nuqul maxalli ah ayaa ah waxa kaliya ee ku badbaadinaya haddii wax la seegay.','Deleting local copies cannot be undone from this screen. Take a backup first — the Zinn® Connector plugin can do that for you.'=>'Tiridda nuqullada maxalliga ah lagama noqon karo shaashaddan. Marka hore qaado koobi kayd ah — furaha Zinn® Connector ayaa taas kuu qaban kara.','This site is not connected to Zinn® storage yet, so there is nowhere to move media to.'=>'Boggani weli kuma xidhna kaydka Zinn®, sidaa darteed meel loo raro warbaahinta ma jirto.','%d attachment moved.'=>'%d lifaaq ayaa la raray.' . "\0" . '%d lifaaq ayaa la wareejiyay.','This site is not connected to Zinn® storage.'=>'Boggan kuma xirna kaydka Zinn®.','Nothing is wrong — it has simply not been paired yet. Media stays on this server until it is.'=>'Waxba ma khaldana — kaliya weli lama lammaanayn. Warbaahintu waxay ku sii jiraysaa server-kan ilaa inta laga lammaanaynayo.','Connected, but the last upload failed.'=>'Waa ku xidhan yahay, laakiin soo-dejintii u dambaysay way fashilantay.','Try a batch now'=>'Isku day xidhmo hadda','Connected. Every attachment has been moved.'=>'Waa la xiriiriyay. Lifaaq kasta waa la raray.','Connected. %1$s of %2$s attachments still on this server.'=>'Waa lagu xidhay. %1$s ka mid ah %2$s lifaaq ayaa wali ku jira serferkan.','Moved so far'=>'Ilaa hadda la raray','%1$s files, %2$s'=>'%1$s fayl, %2$s','Still on this server'=>'Weli ku jira server-kan','%1$s of %2$s attachments'=>'%1$s ka mid ah %2$s lifaaqyo ah','Served from'=>'Laga adeegay','this server'=>'server-kan','Connect this site'=>'Ku xidh boggan','Open your Zinn Digital® dashboard, choose this site, open Files & databases, and press “Get a pairing code” under Images & video CDN. Paste the code below.'=>'Fur dashboard-kaaga Zinn Digital®, dooro boggan, fur Faylasha & xog-ururinta, oo taabo "Hel koodhka lammaanaynta" ee ku hoos jira Sawirrada & muuqaalka CDN. Ku dheji koodhka hoos.','Pairing code'=>'Koodhka isku-xirka','Disconnect this site'=>'Ka jar goobtan','New uploads will stay on this server. Media already moved keeps working — its address does not change.'=>'Soo-dejinta cusub waxay ku sii jiri doonaan serfarkan. Warbaahinta mar hore la raray waxay sii wadi doontaa shaqada — cinwaankeedu ma isbeddelayo.','You do not have permission to manage this site.'=>'Uma lihid ogolaansho inaad maamusho goobtan.','Paste the pairing code from your Zinn Digital® dashboard.'=>'Ku dheji koodhka lammaanaynta dashboard-kaaga Zinn Digital®.','Connected. New uploads will be stored with Zinn Digital® from now on, and your existing media will move in the background.'=>'Waa lagu xidhay. Waxyaabaha cusub ee la soo geliyo waxaa laga bilaabo hadda lagu kaydin doonaa Zinn Digital®, warbaahintaada hadda jirtana waxa loo rari doonaa xagga dambe.','Disconnected. Media already moved keeps working; new uploads stay on this server.'=>'Xiriirkii waa go\'ay. Warbaahinta horay loo raray way sii shaqaynaysaa; waxyaabaha cusub ee la soo geliyo waxay ku harayaan adeegahan.','That file could not be read from this server, so nothing was uploaded.'=>'Faylkaas lagama akhrin karin adeegaha, markaa waxba lama soo gelin.','This site could not stream the upload, so nothing was sent.'=>'Boggani ma awoodin inuu sii daayo soo-gelinta, markaa waxba lama dirin.','This file is %1$s and this site\'s PHP has no cURL, so the largest it can upload is %2$s.'=>'Faylkani waa %1$s, PHP-ga boggani ma laha cURL, markaa xaddiga ugu weyn ee uu soo geli karo waa %2$s.','The upload could not be completed.'=>'Soo gelinta lama dhamaystiri karin.','Storage refused the upload (HTTP %d).'=>'Kaydku wuu diiday gelinta (HTTP %d).','Style preset'=>'Habaysan qaabka','A starting point. Anything below overrides it.'=>'Barta bilowga. Wax kasta oo ka hooseeya ayaa beddelaya.','Use my own colours and sizes'=>'Isticmaal midabadayda iyo cabbirradayda gaarka ah','Leave this off and the preset is used exactly as it is.'=>'Kani daaran ha ka tagin oo horudhaca waxaa loo isticmaali doonaa sida saxda ah ee uu yahay.','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Eeg qoraalada warbixinta Zinn Digital®.','The Zinn® update service did not issue a download link for this update. Check that this site can reach the Zinn® platform, then try again.'=>'Adeegga cusboonaysiinta Zinn® ma soo saarin xiriirinta soo dejinta ee cusboonaysiintan. Hubi in goobtani gaari karto madal Zinn®, ka dibna mar kale isku day.','The update could not be downloaded from the Zinn® update service (%s). Try again in a few minutes.'=>'Cusboonaysiinta lagama soo dejisan karin adeegga cusboonaysiinta Zinn® (%s). Isku day mar kale dhowr daqiiqo gudahood.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Cusboonaysiinta la soo dejiyay kuma guulaysan hubinta saxnimada lamana rakibin.']];